2:["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-fg-muted leading-relaxed mb-4","children":"High ad click-through rate proves that your hook, creative, and target audience alignment generated interest. Post-click conversion requires strict continuity across six operational dimensions:"}]
3:["$","div",null,{"className":"grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"rounded-lg border border-border bg-bg p-4","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg text-sm mb-1","children":"1. Message Continuity"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs text-fg-muted","children":"The exact promise in the ad copy must be mirrored in the landing page H1 headline."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"rounded-lg border border-border bg-bg p-4","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg text-sm mb-1","children":"2. Price Transparency"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs text-fg-muted","children":"Hiding price or shipping fees until late checkout stages triggers sudden abandonment."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"rounded-lg border border-border bg-bg p-4","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg text-sm mb-1","children":"3. Proof Near Decision Points"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs text-fg-muted","children":"Testimonials or ratings placed away from the primary CTA fail to reassure hesitant buyers."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"rounded-lg border border-border bg-bg p-4","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg text-sm mb-1","children":"4. Form & Action Friction"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs text-fg-muted","children":"Asking for unnecessary fields or displaying competing links dilutes conversion intent."}]]}]]}]
4:["$","section",null,{"className":"mb-14","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-fg mb-6","children":"Six reasons ads convert to clicks but not sales"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-4","children":[["$","div","0",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-border bg-bg-muted/20 p-6","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 mb-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"shrink-0 font-mono text-xs text-fg-dim mt-0.5","children":"01"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-accent mb-0.5","children":"Message Match"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-base font-semibold text-fg","children":"Ad promised X - landing page delivers Y"}]]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-fg-muted leading-6 mb-3 pl-7","children":"The ad copy set a specific expectation: a price point, a product type, a use case, a promotional offer. The landing page the visitor arrived at addresses a different angle or uses different language. The visitor cannot reconcile the two in under three seconds, so they leave. This is the single largest source of post-click abandonment in paid search. It is not about aesthetics - it is a literal mismatch between the claim that generated the click and the claim the page leads with."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"pl-7 border-l-2 border-accent/30 ml-7","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs font-semibold text-accent uppercase tracking-wider mb-1","children":"Fix"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-fg-muted leading-6","children":"Put the ad's primary promise - verbatim or near-verbatim - in the H1. If the ad says \"Free shipping on orders over $50,\" the page headline confirms it immediately. One ad group per landing page variant is the structural fix."}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-border bg-bg-muted/20 p-6","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 mb-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"shrink-0 font-mono text-xs text-fg-dim mt-0.5","children":"02"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-accent mb-0.5","children":"Social Proof"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-base font-semibold text-fg","children":"No proof above the fold - visitor is asked to act before they have a reason to trust"}]]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-fg-muted leading-6 mb-3 pl-7","children":"The primary CTA appears before the visitor has seen evidence that the product works. For cold paid traffic - a visitor who has never heard of the brand - this sequence is backward. They arrived via an ad, which is inherently an unverified claim. Asking them to purchase or sign up before providing any third-party validation (a review count, a named testimonial, a visible star rating) requires a level of trust the page has not yet earned."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"pl-7 border-l-2 border-accent/30 ml-7","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs font-semibold text-accent uppercase tracking-wider mb-1","children":"Fix"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-fg-muted leading-6","children":"Place at minimum one trust signal above the fold: a star rating with review count, a named customer quote with a specific outcome, or a recognizable logo with context. The CTA adjacent to proof outperforms the CTA alone."}]]}]]}],["$","div","2",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-border bg-bg-muted/20 p-6","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 mb-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"shrink-0 font-mono text-xs text-fg-dim mt-0.5","children":"03"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-accent mb-0.5","children":"Price / Commitment Shock"}],"$L15"]}]]}],"$L16","$L17"]}],"$L18","$L19","$L1a"]}]]}]
